      "apply": "none",
      "settable": true,
      "reason": null,
      "value": "MikroTik RouterOS switches (CRS3xx/CRS5xx, RouterOS 7) managed by TAPPaaS: brings mikrotik-controller (Ansible, community.routeros) for switch-manager — VLAN trunks and access ports, parking, LACP aggregates and MLAG pairs. Installs nothing on any machine; each switch is added with setup-credentials.sh."
